0 INVIS 'MASS INVIS' INVISIBILITY~
Syntax: cast 'invisibility' <character>

       cast 'invisibility' <object>
       cast 'mass invis'
Invis makes the target character or object invisible. Invisible characters
become visible when they attack. Mass invis makes everyone in the room
invisible. Use 'visible' to remove the effect.

