0 SHIELD 'STONE SKIN'~
Syntax: cast shield <character>

        cast 'stone skin' 
These spells protect the caster or target by decreasing (improving) the 
caster's armor class. SHIELD provides 20 points of armor. STONE SKIN 
provides 40 points of armor. Shield can be cast on others, while stone
skin may only target yourself.

Learned by: Shield  -  Mage (20), Conjurer (21), Enchanter (22), Invoker (22), Cleric (35), Druid (36), Warrior (45), Paladin (37), Ranger (36), Thief (40), Runist (32), Monk (35)
Stone Skin  -  Mage (25), Conjurer (26), Enchanter (26), Invoker (27), Cleric (40), Druid (40), Warrior (40), Paladin (40), Ranger (40), Thief (45), Runist (36), Monk (40)

