0 MARKSMANSHIP~
All rangers have learned how to wield a ranged weapon.  There are various
ranged combat skills available, but all of them require the marksmanship
ability to be successful in hitting the target.  A player must be holding a
quiver of the correct ammo type for their ranged weapon.  Bows use arrows,
crossbows use bolts, and various other weapons use 'bullets' (often dart
guns).  Ranged weapons can be used in combat, but to do so, the ranger must
drop their guard, making themselves very vulnerable.  Use 'shoot' to do a
simple single-shot attack, while the other skills require more focus, and
can only be performed every so often.  The skill, 'aiming' improves all of
the ranged attacks.  
Current marksmanship related commands are:
Shoot, pindown, barrage, aiming, and bleeder.

Learned by:
Ranger (5)

